    <div class="fx-web-foot">{{ t(
      'HEAT = independent leading surfaces (physical bottleneck · demand · guidance · insider/award · subsector scarcity · discovery echo) converging on one theme, weighted by earliness (inverse to how priced the revisions already are) and gated by a physical correlate. Multi-surface agreement raises precision; earliness keeps it ahead of the crowd. Not a return forecast — forward-graded like every leg.',
      '热度＝独立领先面（物理瓶颈·需求·指引·内部人/中标·子行业短缺·发现回声）在单一主题上的共振，按早期度（与预期被定价程度相反）加权，并以物理佐证为门槛。多面一致提升精度；早期度使其领先人群。非收益预测——与每条腿一样前瞻评分。') }}</div>

