      </div>
      {% endfor %}
      <div class="fx-ai-foot">{{ analyst.disclaimer }} {{ t('The deterministic monitor re-checks each thesis against its convergence every build and flags BROKEN before the tape confirms. The model is FORBIDDEN to forecast a price.', '确定性监视器每次构建都依据其共振重新核验每个论点，并在行情确认前标记失效。模型被禁止预测价格。') }}</div>
