    <div class="sub">{{ t(
      'The cascade above can only <b>confirm</b> the 18 themes we already named. This layer is how the desk answers <i>"what should I be looking at that I\'m not?"</i> — it sweeps physical-scarcity language across <b>all</b> of EDGAR and surfaces industries where a cluster of <b>un-tracked</b> companies is independently reporting "on allocation / extended lead times / record backlog". Each is a <b>candidate on probation</b> — never a buy, never auto-added; it earns a tracked slot only when a physical correlate fires. The pre-13D discovery state.',
      '上方级联只能<b>确认</b>已命名的18个主题。本层回答<i>“我还应该关注什么却没关注？”</i>——扫描整个 EDGAR 的物理短缺用语，找出一批<b>未跟踪</b>公司在同一行业里独立报告“配额／交期拉长／创纪录在手订单”的行业。每个都是<b>观察期候选</b>——绝非买入、不自动纳入；只有物理佐证出现才升级为正式主题。即13D之前的发现状态。') }}</div>
