      'The cascade runs the same <b>bottleneck × revision</b> signature over all <b>113 Finviz sub-industries</b> (503 names), not just the 18 curated themes — so you can see, market-wide, <b>where supply scarcity and estimate revisions are aligning</b>. The bottleneck here is a <b>text-only proxy</b> (EDGAR scarcity language), not FRED-confirmed — a screen to investigate, not a confirmed thesis.',
      '级联将同一<b>瓶颈 × 预期修正</b>信号运行于全部<b>113个 Finviz 子行业</b>（503只成分股），而不仅是18个精选主题——从而在全市场范围看到<b>供给短缺与盈利预期在何处共振</b>。此处瓶颈为<b>纯文本代理</b>（EDGAR 短缺用语），非 FRED 确认——是待查筛选，而非确认论点。') }}
